al;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase\">IIITB &amp; MICROSOFT<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading sec-head wow wd wd_0.5s fadeInUp has-blue-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-d9b01335e9bac91bc4075919377f731d\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">A Complementary Partnership<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-973128ee wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:0.75rem;margin-bottom:0\">\n<p class=\"f-20-16 wow wd wd_0.7s fadeInUp has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-4d1c6129cdebc015469a94400020c75a wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400\">The AI Innovation and Inclusion Initiative (A4I) is a collaboration between&nbsp;Microsoft&nbsp;as innovation enablers, and&nbsp;IIIT-Bangalore&nbsp;as the impact partner. The initiative combines Microsoft\u2019s cutting-edge AI capabilities and innovations with IIIT-B\u2019s expertise in research, solution-scaling and field-driven deployment to transform proven innovations into scalable Digital Public Goods (DPGs). A4I provides a structured framework for governance, partnerships, and scale, enabling high-impact AI solutions to reach underserved communities effectively.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group wow wd wd_0.5s fadeInUp is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3a88641f wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\"><div class=\"cta-sec \">\r\n  <a href=\"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/iiitb-microsoft\/\" class=\"\"> \r\n    <div class=\"span\">\r\n      <div class=\"left\"> \r\n        <span class=\"first-one\">KNOW MORE<\/span>\r\n        <span class=\"second-one\">KNOW MORE<\/span>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    \r\n<div class=\"c-arrow\">\r\n      <div class=\"arrow-wrap\">\r\n        <div class=\"first-one\">\r\n        <svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"